---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import ContactCTA from "../../components/ContactCTA.astro"
import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro"
---
<BaseLayout title="November Events | Side Quests Colorado" description="November 2026 Events">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="November 2026 Writing Events"
				tagline="Check out the cool events you can go to in November."
			>
				<img
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/november-writing.png"
					alt="An open notebook"
				/>
    </Hero>
<section>
	<h2 class="section-title">Writing</h2>
		<div class="content">
			<h3>Nov 5: Colorado Side Quests Virtual Writing Meetup</h3>
				<p>7:30 PM to 8:30 PM via Zoom</p>
				<p><a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/LupsAdnfThmCqntIkQgSzw" target="_blank">Register for the meetup here</a></p>
		</div>
		<div class="content">
			<h3>DenNoWriMos November Novel Writing Events</h3>
				<p>Daily Writing Events both in-person throughout Colorado and virtual.</p>
				<p>Check out their <a href="https://dennowrimo.org/events/" target="_blank">event calendar here</a>.</p>
		</div>
</section>
<section>
		<h2 class="section-title">Disclaimers</h2>
			<div class="content">
				<p>
				Colorado Side Quests does not endorse any of the events, organizations and individuals listed on this page or on our site. The information provided is information only. Attend any event at your own risk. Neither Colorado Side Quests, nor it's contributors are not responsible for your health, safety or wellbeing and will not be held responsible for any real or percieved injuries you face after attending any of the events listed on our site or by using any third-party links on our site. We cannot control you or any third-party individual or organization or their website. Use the Colorado Side Quests website or Instagram at your own risk.
				</p>
			</div>
			</section>
      </main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>